From 7816675012d6aae66a764dc04a0e1862795d3cfc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: gz <gz@local>
Date: Sat, 27 Jun 2026 20:15:22 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Extend gpu_composite with GLES2 2D batch, plane bake, and
